			dependencies: ["56766749439CD7E0"]
			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"Energy is your way to get any machine working. Now that you have generators its good idea to find how to distribute, direct and overal control it where you need."
				""
				"Most of generators use Forge Energy and produce energy in FE/t, where 't' means tick and counts as 1/20 of a second."
